    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Pour Les Pattounes is a pet sitter based in the Valescure area of Saint-Raphaël, covering Fréjus and Saint-Raphaël. She presents herself as a pet sitter, dog trainer and behaviourist. The service offered is home sitting: visits and walks at the owner's home while they're away — it is not boarding with accommodation at her place.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>Beyond dogs and cats, the provider also takes care of rabbits, birds, reptiles and rodents, with fun activities and a dog training side on top. The contact details and the activity are confirmed by the official legal notices of the pourlespattounes.fr website — a good level of confidence. Prices, however, are not published in detail publicly: a dedicated page exists on the site, but without amounts shown, so it's best to ask for a quote directly.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: for a dog that gets anxious about a change of environment, home sitting like this avoids the stress of boarding — but check carefully that no accommodation at the provider's home is offered, if that's what you're looking for.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Valescure area, between Saint-Raphaël and the Esterel forest, and the beaches of Fréjus are nearby.</p>
